This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-face_blur layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-face_blur layer to your build
 II. Purpose


I. Adding the meta-face_blur layer to your build
=================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-face_blur'


II. Purpose
============

Face Blur:
  This application blur the human faces which are captured in the live streaming.
  
  Uses a face detection model (e.g., Haar cascades, SSD, or MTCNN) to locate faces.
  
  Applies a blur filter (Gaussian blur) to the detected face regions.
  
  Displays or saves the modified video with blurred faces in real-time.